            "summary": "The skill mostly matches its ABA keyword-analysis purpose, but it bundles high-impact account, credential, upload, report, and self-modification behaviors that need careful review.",
            "dimensions": [
              {
                "detail": "Credential-bearing API calls read gateway destinations from environment variables without host allowlisting, and the ABA code defaults to a test-sz LinkFox gateway while the reference documentation names the production tool gateway.",
