              {
                "detail": "The top-level instructions are mostly scoped to ABA SFR analysis, but they also direct the agent to invoke a skill creator to make or revise its own skill when users request capability changes, which can move behavior outside the reviewed artifact.",
                "label": "Instruction Scope",
                "name": "instruction_scope",
